    },
    "授予麦克风权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grant Microphone Access"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "控制整理模型对转录文本的改写程度。最低只删除填充词、重复的句子和无意义的口头语，补全标点；中等在此基础上理顺句子，但不增删内容；最高则把转录当作草稿，按原意完全重写。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controls how much the polishing model may rewrite the transcript. Low only removes filler words, repeated sentences, and meaningless verbal tics, adding punctuation; Medium additionally smooths sentences without adding or removing content; High treats the transcript as a draft and fully rewrites it while preserving your meaning."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "控制输出文本的组织形式。最低保持说话时的自然分段，不添加任何结构；中等在内容适合列举时使用简单的项目符号或编号；最高则用小节标题、项目符号等完整层级来组织内容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Controls how the output text is organized. Low keeps the natural paragraphs of your speech without any added structure; Medium uses simple bullets or numbering when the content suits listing; High organizes content with a full hierarchy of section headings and bullet points."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "提示：若使用 Fn，请先在 系统设置 → 键盘 中把「按下 🌐 键时」设为「无操作」。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tip: if you use Fn, first set System Settings → Keyboard → “Press 🌐 key to” to “Do nothing”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
